== Hero Ability ==

The Chronomancer multiplies Sources profit by:
<br><math>L^2 \times C \times ((T + S) \times G)^{0.64} \times 0.25 + 1</math>
<br>where:
* <math>C = \text{Character Ability Power}</math>
* <math>G = \text{Character Ability Power Growth Rate}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Hero Level}</math>
* <math>T = \text{Character Play Time}</math>
* <math>S = \text{Skipped Time}</math>


==Compressed Time==
Compressed Time is a resource unique to {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Chronomancer}} and {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Temporalist}}. It is generated over time, and by casting {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Singularity Beam}}. 

It has a maximum capacity of:
<math>L \times 5</math>

It is required to cast certain spells: {{SpellGallery |title=Compressed Time Spells |add_cost=Compressed Time }}

==Time Distortion==

Time Distortion is a unique resource. increases the game's timescaling; the rate at which the game processes time per real second. It is only available to {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Chronomancer}} and {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Temporalist}}. Time Distortion is gained by casting {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Temporal Distortion}}. It degenerates by 0.1x per real second, and is consumed entirely by {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Stabilize The Flow}}. Time Distortion has a maximum of 10x, which can be increased up to 30x through items and an upgrade.

