==Lore==
{{Lore|Time traveling techniques were thought to be nigh impossible to attain by the magical society, though some manipulation has been proved be plausible by the most cunning experimenters. While exact time or means cannot be discerned now, since the beginning of the Void exploration age, there've been reports of strangers with knowledge of future or past events appearing all around the world. Over time, this peculiar caste of wizards became known as Chronomancers.}}

